- content_for :title, "Naked and Afraid Gear Guides"
- content_for :meta_description, "Guides to the knives, fire starters, fishing gear, pots and more used on Naked and Afraid, with the products you can buy and where each was spotted on the show."
- content_for :canonical_url, shop_guides_url

.container.my-4
  nav.small.mb-2
    = link_to "Shop", shop_path, class: "text-decoration-none text-muted"
    span.mx-1 &raquo;
    span Guides
  h1.h3.mb-2 Naked and Afraid Gear Guides
  p.text-muted.small.mb-3(style="max-width: 760px;")
    | One page per kind of gear: what survivalists brought, and the products you can buy that match it or come closest.

  = render "shop/disclosure"

  .row.g-3
    - @guides.each do |g|
      .col-md-6
        = link_to shop_guide_path(g.slug), class: "card h-100 shadow-sm text-decoration-none" do
          .card-body
            h2.h5.mb-1 = g.title
            p.small.text-muted.mb-2 = g.description
            span.badge.bg-secondary = "#{@counts[g.category]} products"
